<nav class="crumbs"><a href="/dashboard">Repositories</a><span>/</span>acme</nav><div class="head"><div><h1><span class="owner">acme/</span>widgets</h1><div class="badges"><span class="badge b-green">Merge mode</span><span class="badge b-sable">Merge engine</span></div></div><a class="btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/acme/widgets">Open on GitHub ↗</a></div><section class="hero"><div class="hero-main"><div class="kicker">Time saved · last 30 days</div><div class="big">2.5 h</div><p class="caption">less waiting than a one-at-a-time merge queue</p></div><div class="hero-side"><div class="kicker">Median time from ready to landed</div><div class="compare"><div class="crow"><span class="clabel">Sheltie</span><progress class="pbar pbar-a" max="100" value="12.0" aria-hidden="true"></progress><span class="cval">3 min</span></div><div class="crow"><span class="clabel">One at a time</span><progress class="pbar pbar-b" max="100" value="100.0" aria-hidden="true"></progress><span class="cval">25 min</span></div></div><p class="fine">CI on the default branch takes 9 min (median, measured).</p></div></section>
<div class="metrics">
<div class="metric"><span class="mlabel">Author time saved</span><b>2 h</b><span class="mnote">15 min per conflict, 30 per replay (assumed)</span></div>
<div class="metric"><span class="mlabel">Conflicts resolved</span><b>7</b><span class="mnote">6 by the merge engine · 1 re-derived</span></div>
<div class="metric"><span class="mlabel">Landed</span><b>12</b><span class="mnote">through Sheltie</span></div>
