</div>
<details class="how"><summary>How this is estimated</summary><p>Waiting time compares Sheltie's real landing times with a one-at-a-time merge queue simulated from the same ready times: each pull request lands one CI run after the later of its ready time and the previous landing. The CI time is the median measured on the default branch. Author time counts conflicts Sheltie resolved without the author, at the minutes per fix set in <code>[estimates]</code> in <code>.sheltie/merge.toml</code>. <a href="https://sheltie.dev/docs/dashboard.html#time-saved">More</a></p></details><section class="panel activity"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Activity</h2><span class="fine">Landings per day, last 30 days</span></div><svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 70 48" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="Landings per day"><defs><linearGradient id="gchart" x1="0" y1="1" x2="0" y2="0"><stop class="stop-a" offset="0"/><stop class="stop-b" offset="1"/></linearGradient></defs><rect class="bar-zero" x="0" y="46" width="7" height="2" rx="1.5"><title>Oct 11: 0 landings</title></rect><rect class="bar" x="10" y="30" width="7" height="18" rx="1.5" fill="url(#gchart)"><title>Oct 12: 2 landings</title></rect><rect class="bar" x="20" y="4" width="7" height="44" rx="1.5" fill="url(#gchart)"><title>Oct 13: 5 landings</title></rect><rect class="bar" x="30" y="39" width="7" height="9" rx="1.5" fill="url(#gchart)"><title>Oct 14: 1 landing</title></rect><rect class="bar-zero" x="40" y="46" width="7" height="2" rx="1.5"><title>Oct 15: 0 landings</title></rect><rect class="bar-zero" x="50" y="46" width="7" height="2" rx="1.5"><title>Oct 16: 0 landings</title></rect><rect class="bar" x="60" y="22" width="7" height="26" rx="1.5" fill="url(#gchart)"><title>Oct 17: 3 landings</title></rect></svg><div class="axis"><span>Sep 18</span><span>Today</span></div>
<div class="now"><div><b>1</b><span>Ready</span></div><div><b>2</b><span>In flight</span></div><div><b>7</b><span>Landed in 24 h</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Returned in 24 h</span></div></div></section><section class="panel spend"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Agent spend</h2><span class="fine">Intent replays, last 30 days · estimated by the agent</span></div><div class="spend-body"><div class="spend-main"><div class="amount">$4.35</div><p class="caption">3 replays · 2 passed the checks</p><div class="crow budget"><span class="clabel">Last 24 h</span><progress class="pbar pbar-c" max="100" value="15.5" aria-label="Daily budget used"></progress><span class="cval">$3.10 of $20.00</span></div></div><div class="spend-chart"><svg class="chart chart-spend" viewBox="0 0 70 48" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="Agent spend per day"><defs><linearGradient id="gspend" x1="0" y1="1" x2="0" y2="0"><stop class="stop-a" offset="0"/><stop class="stop-b" offset="1"/></linearGradient></defs><rect class="bar-zero" x="0" y="46" width="7" height="2" rx="1.5"><title>Oct 11: $0.00</title></rect><rect class="bar-zero" x="10" y="46" width="7" height="2" rx="1.5"><title>Oct 12: $0.00</title></rect><rect class="bar" x="20" y="30" width="7" height="18" rx="1.5" fill="url(#gspend)"><title>Oct 13: $1.25</title></rect><rect class="bar-zero" x="30" y="46" width="7" height="2" rx="1.5"><title>Oct 14: $0.00</title></rect><rect class="bar-zero" x="40" y="46" width="7" height="2" rx="1.5"><title>Oct 15: $0.00</title></rect><rect class="bar-zero" x="50" y="46" width="7" height="2" rx="1.5"><title>Oct 16: $0.00</title></rect><rect class="bar" x="60" y="4" width="7" height="44" rx="1.5" fill="url(#gspend)"><title>Oct 17: $3.10</title></rect></svg><div class="axis"><span>Sep 18</span><span>Today</span></div></div></div><div class="spend-stats"><div><span class="mlabel">Tokens</span><b>1.9M</b><span class="mnote">41k in · 12k out · 1.8M cache read · 96k cache write · from 2 of 3 replays</span></div><div><span class="mlabel">Per replay</span><b>$1.45</b><span class="mnote">average estimated cost</span></div><div><span class="mlabel">Per hour saved</span><b>$2.17</b><span class="mnote">spend per hour of author time saved</span></div></div><p class="fine spend-note">Costs are Claude Code's own estimates, not your bill. Replays run on your CI runners with your API key. <a href="https://sheltie.dev/docs/dashboard.html#agent-spend">More</a></p></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Queue</h2><span class="count">1</span></div><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Pull request</th><th>State</th><th>Footprint</th><th>Next</th><th class="r">Updated</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><div class="prcell"><a class="num-chip" href="https://github.com/acme/widgets/pull/7">#7</a><span class="ttl">&lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;</span></div></td><td><span class="badge b-blue">Ready</span></td><td><span class="fp"><b>2</b> writes · <b>3</b> affected</span></td><td class="plan">will land now</td><td class="r muted nowrap">just now</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Recently landed</h2></div><ol class="timeline"><li><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="tl-main"><a class="num-chip" href="https://github.com/acme/widgets/pull/6">#6</a><span class="ttl">Rename rate()</span></div><div class="tl-meta"><a class="sha" href="https://github.com/acme/widgets/commit/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa">aaaaaaa</a><span class="badge b-green">speculative build</span><span class="badge b-sable">re-derived from its intent (4b)</span><span class="muted nowrap">3 min ago</span></div></li></ol></section>
